#: src/renderer/src/agents/bringChangesBack.logic.ts
msgid "{branch} has uncommitted changes in {files}, and Sotto won’t bring back uncommitted work. Commit them first, then try again."
msgstr "{branch} has uncommitted changes in {files}, and Sotto won’t bring back uncommitted work. Commit them first, then try again."

#: src/renderer/src/agents/bringChangesBack.logic.ts
msgid "{branch} starts from a check’s snapshot of uncommitted changes, and Sotto won’t bring that back as a commit. Ask this thread to put its own commits on a branch made from {target}, then try again."
msgstr "{branch} starts from a check’s snapshot of uncommitted changes, and Sotto won’t bring that back as a commit. Ask this thread to put its own commits on a branch made from {target}, then try again."

#: src/renderer/src/agents/bringChangesBack.logic.ts
msgid "{branch} was made from {target}."
msgstr "{branch} was made from {target}."

