#: src/renderer/src/agents/bringChangesBack.logic.ts
msgid "{target} already has every commit on {branch}."
msgstr "{target} already has every commit on {branch}."

#: src/renderer/src/agents/bringChangesBack.logic.ts
msgid "{target} has {theirs} that {branch} doesn’t, so Git can’t fast-forward. Sotto can make a merge commit on {target} that brings in this branch’s {ours}. Nothing is rebased or forced, and this worktree stays as it is."
msgstr "{target} has {theirs} that {branch} doesn’t, so Git can’t fast-forward. Sotto can make a merge commit on {target} that brings in this branch’s {ours}. Nothing is rebased or forced, and this worktree stays as it is."

